@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Product Owner" as Employee
participant "System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : requests to start the cargo generation simulator
        activate System

            System --> Employee : confirms simulator has started
            System --> System : gathers existing stations and \n collects data from  cities and industries
            System --> Employee : starts cargo generation based on \n supply and demand
        deactivate System

        Employee -> System : requests to pause the simulator
        activate System

            System --> Employee : confirms simulator is paused and waits for play

        deactivate System
        Employee -> System : requests to start the simulator again
        activate System

            System --> System: confirms simulator started again and continues \n cargo generation from where it stopped
            System --> Employee: finishes generation when the maximum is reached,\n  displays the generated cargo and displays success




@enduml